  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2015 Financial Audit of Rainbow Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiell revision Rainbow Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att granska den ekonomiska rapporten f&#xf6;r perioden 2015/01/01 till 2015/12/31 som l&#xe4;mnas till Sida och revisionsuttalande enligt ISA 800/805 om huruvida den ekonomiska rapporten f&#xf6;r Rainbow -projektet &#xe4;r i enlighet med Sidas anvisningar f&#xf6;r finansiell rapportering som anges i avtalet mellan Sida och Kaos GL ; bilaga IV till avtalet mellan Kaos GL och Sida .</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to audit the Financial report for the period 2015.01.01 to 2015.12.31 as submitted to Sida and to express an audit opinion according to ISA 800/805 on whether the financial report of the Rainbow Project is in accordance with Sida&apos;s instructions for financial reporting as stipulated in the agreement between Sida and Kaos GL; annex IV to the agreement between Kaos GL and Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
